     1395     X_place.PS AT ROW 22 COL 1 NO-LABEL
     1396     VIEW-AS EDITOR
     1397     SIZE 98 BY 1.75
     1398     mark-num AT ROW 1.17 COL 12.13 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     1399     SPACE(80.43) SKIP(20.25)
     1400     WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
     1401     SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
